<h2 id="e1.notes">Notes</h2>
<p>A coffee here costs $5 or $10, depending on the cup.<sup class="footnote-ref"><a href="#e1.fn-cup" id="e1.fnref-cup" data-footnote-ref>1</a></sup></p>
